  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f317010-2b02-4b0c-a416-34b3f207ca44"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives one uniformly sampled vertex-list path from the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraDeformation"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraDeformation", 
